WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:06.160
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is Not Allowed
To Do At The Foundation: SCP-963 is not to

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:09.920
be used for recreational or procreational
purposes.

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:14.160
Well, uh, this one leaves a frightening amount
open to interpretation.

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:19.040
SCP-963 is Dr. Bright’s medallion which
houses his consciousness and can pass it on

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:19.840
to others.

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:24.560
If ever it remains connected to one body for
over thirty days, it leaves a permanent copy

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:28.960
inside the body, meaning Dr. Bright could
theoretically make clones of himself.

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:33.360
He’s generally not allowed to do the latter
under any circumstances, but especially if

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:38.160
the plan is to, say, use the copy to do menial
chores or stand in for him at more boring

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:41.120
meetings while Dr. Bright plays solitaire
in his office.

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:44.240
And they definitely wouldn’t tolerate Dr.
Bright committing any…

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:45.200
Um…

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:47.600
Onanism…

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:50.880
With his clones, thank you very much.

